	<TextRow
		Label="msg_wbt_player_title_19"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かぜを　ふかせろ！
せんぷうを　まきおこせ！▼
トーナメントの　もうしご！
[Name:TrainerName ]！　たいふうの　めとなれ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T07:51:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>風を　吹かせろ！
旋風を　巻き起こせ！▼
トーナメントの　申し子！
[Name:TrainerName ]！　台風の目となれ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-17T07:52:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
